data: {"id": "2d8778bf211e4812-final", "run_id": "2d8778bf211e4812", "seq": 1080, "ts_ms": 1789370049095, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v13/workload` | Terminating | Pod aiops-case-v13/workload 处于 Terminating 状态（存在 deletionTimestamp），但容器未退出且 phase 仍为 Running，形成 Terminating 卡死。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase`: Running | 确认 Pod 处于活跃状态，未发生正常退出 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `deletion_timestamp`: 1789373867 | 确认 Pod 已被发起删除操作，触发终止流程 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | `application started` (07:12:45.704) | 确认应用容器正常启动 |\n| 4 | Logging | elasticsearch | `SIGTERM received; waiting` (07:12:47.189) | 确认应用捕获了终止信号并进入等待逻辑 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase`: 1 (Running), 0 (Pending) | 确认 Pod 持续保持在 Running 状态，未转为 Pending 或其他状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 0 | 排除因应用崩溃导致的重启干扰 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 状态与 Metrics 数据一致，证明 Pod 在被标记删除后仍长时间保持 `Running` 状态（证据 1, 2, 5）。关键证据在于应用日志记录到了 `SIGTERM received` 后紧跟 `waiting`（证据 4），这表明应用进程没有崩溃，而是被设计为处理 SIGTERM 信号，但在当前运行环境中未能从等待状态中解脱，这是导致 Terminating 卡死的核心矛盾。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 触发删除并设置 deletionTimestamp → Kubelet 发送 SIGTERM 信号 → 应用进程捕获信号并进入等待逻辑 (waiting for file) → 应用进程未收到终止条件，拒绝退出导致 Terminating 卡死\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是**应用进程实现不完善的优雅退出逻辑**。应用虽然在容器收到 `SIGTERM` 信号时正确处理了信号（证据 4），但随后进入阻塞等待特定条件（文件 `/state/teardown-requested` 被创建）的状态，且该条件从未满足。由于应用进程持续运行并持有资源，Kubernetes 无法完成容器清理，导致 Pod 陷入 `Terminating` 状态（证据 1, 2）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 47.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v13/workload: 47.4s (Evidence 36.9s, RCA 10.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v13/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 81.704, "metrics": {"run_id": "2d8778bf211e4812", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 81.71020126342773, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 81710.20126342773, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 76510.80584526062, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 14516.88551902771, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4850.953102111816}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 26343.21355819702, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 47357.93447494507, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7989.238023757935, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

